WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.449 --> 00:00:04.508
- [Voiceover] This is the red-kneed tarantula.

00:00:04.508 --> 00:00:06.758
She's got quite the outfit.

00:00:07.737 --> 00:00:10.184
Unfortunately, her striking features

00:00:10.184 --> 00:00:14.351
have made her a hot commodity
in the illegal pet trade.

00:00:15.412 --> 00:00:18.629
Found in the forests
of southwestern Mexico,

00:00:18.629 --> 00:00:21.150
red-kneeds are some of
the largest spiders,

00:00:21.150 --> 00:00:23.911
growing up to eight inches in size.

00:00:23.911 --> 00:00:25.195
Besides size,

00:00:25.195 --> 00:00:28.068
their beautiful red, white,
black and orange hairs

00:00:28.068 --> 00:00:31.187
are what separates them
from other spiders.

00:00:31.187 --> 00:00:34.305
The hairs on their legs are
used to sense vibrations

00:00:34.305 --> 00:00:36.832
from predators and prey.

00:00:36.832 --> 00:00:39.791
They prey on large
insects, frogs and mice,

00:00:39.791 --> 00:00:42.757
biting and injecting
them with their venom.

00:00:42.757 --> 00:00:44.356
Their alluring look has made them

00:00:44.356 --> 00:00:46.938
the most popular captive tarantula,

00:00:46.938 --> 00:00:50.604
causing a major population decline.

00:00:50.604 --> 00:00:54.410
Today, regulations are in
place requiring permits

00:00:54.410 --> 00:00:57.749
to remove any of these
beauties from the wild.

00:00:57.749 --> 00:01:00.416
This is the red-kneed tarantula.

